1
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:08,514
When the money arrives, open the transaction, enter the amount and a reference

2
00:00:08,514 --> 00:00:13,383
under Record an offline payment, and click Record payment, and confirm.

3
00:00:13,835 --> 00:00:19,725
With Send Payment Receipts on, the customer is sent a receipt after every payment:

4
00:00:19,725 --> 00:00:23,272
online, charged to a card, or recorded by hand.

5
00:00:23,272 --> 00:00:26,886
Each receipt has its own number, such as R-1001.

6
00:00:26,886 --> 00:00:32,775
In the transaction's timeline, the payment links to its receipt with View receipt.

7
00:00:33,226 --> 00:00:34,932
View receipt opens it:

8
00:00:34,932 --> 00:00:39,441
your branding, the receipt number and date, who it is billed to, the

9
00:00:39,441 --> 00:00:42,488
amount paid, and notes such as Paid offline.

10
00:00:42,488 --> 00:00:44,316
Print receipt prints it.

